---
import { Image } from "astro:assets";

import heroImage from "../assets/images/hero.png";
import borobudurBg from "../assets/images/borobudur-bg.png";
---

<section
  class="relative h-screen flex items-center pb-20 overflow-hidden bg-white pt-20 snap-start"
>
  <Image
    src={borobudurBg}
    alt="Siluet Borobudur"
    class="absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-full h-[100%] lg:h-[80%] object-cover object-bottom opacity-15 pointer-events-none z-0"
  />

  <div
    class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 lg:px-8 w-full relative z-10 grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-16 items-center"
  >
    <div class="flex flex-col items-start gap-6">
      <h1
        class="reveal-up font-heading font-extrabold text-5xl lg:text-7xl text-text-primary leading-tight tracking-tight"
      >
        Ekosistem<br />Data Jateng
      </h1>

      <p
        class="reveal-up text-lg lg:text-xl text-text-body leading-relaxed max-w-lg"
        style="transition-delay: 150ms;"
      >
        Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet consectetur adipiscing elit. Consectetur
        adipiscing elit quisque faucibus ex sapien vitae. Ex sapien vitae
        pellentesque sem placerat in id. Placerat in id cursus mi pretium tellus
        duis. Pretium tellus duis convallis tempus leo eu aenean.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="reveal-up w-full relative flex items-center justify-center pt-12 lg:pt-0"
      style="transition-delay: 450ms;"
    >
      <Image
        src={heroImage}
        alt="Visual Ekosistem Data Jateng"
        class="w-[100%] lg:w-[100%] h-auto max-h-[70vh] object-contain transition-transform duration-300 hover:scale-105"
        style="filter: drop-shadow(0 15px 20px rgba(255, 107, 53, 0.2));"
      />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
